OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in direct cremations     
OL,4,Asince pandemic                         
OL,6,FFuneral directors say there has been an
OL,7,Fincrease in direct cremations, with no 
OL,8,Fmourners in attendance, since the      
OL,9,FCovid-19 pandemic.                     
OL,11,FBrian Ugalde, whose firm of funeral    
OL,12,Fdirectors has worked in Cornwall for   
OL,13,F135 years, said non-attendance had     
OL,14,Fbecome more acceptable since the       
OL,15,Flockdowns when families were not always
OL,16,Fallowed to attend.                     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
