OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in direct cremations     
OL,4,Asince pandemic                         
OL,6,F"A funeral is a ceremony... a farewell,
OL,7,Fa celebration... it is for for those   
OL,8,Fleft behind," he said, adding direct   
OL,9,Fcremation came after Covid when "the   
OL,10,Fmodel became acceptable and practical" 
OL,11,Fas well as being cheaper.              
OL,13,FSunLife's 2026 Cost of Dying Report    
OL,14,Ffound direct cremation was now chosen  
OL,15,Ffor about one in five funerals in the  
OL,16,FUK.                                    
